# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Genera el observable que mitiga el ruido {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propaga hacia delante hasta el final del circuito cada generador de Pauli del canal de ruido inverso. Después, el observable se retropropaga a través del canal de ruido inverso, lo que devuelve un nuevo observable $\\tilde{O}$. Tres parámetros clave afectan al coste de cálculo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms`: el número de términos que se conservan en cada generador de antirruido a medida que se propaga hacia delante.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms`: el número de términos que se conservan en $\\tilde{O}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol`: se descartan los términos cuya magnitud de coeficiente está por debajo de este umbral.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Para este circuito pequeño y casi Clifford, fijamos límites altos para los términos y usamos un `atol` modesto, de modo que $\\tilde{O}$ se mantiene pequeño y podemos medir todos sus términos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Nota: esta función usa `multiprocessing` de Python. Al ejecutarla como script, llámala dentro de una protección `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. Mitiga los errores de puertas midiendo el observable que mitiga el ruido {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Aquí vemos que el nuevo observable mitiga eficazmente el ruido de puertas que afecta al experimento.\n"

